---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Opis satova | Flexio Pilates & Yoga Studio Zagreb"
  description="Detaljni opis svih programa: B.A.S.I. Pilates, Pre & Post Natal, Morning Flow, Big Ball, Rhythm Pilates, Power Vinyasa Yoga, Ashtanga Mysore, Vinyasa Basic."
>
  <!-- Hero Section -->
  <section class="relative bg-gradient-to-br from-purple-50 via-pink-50 to-purple-100 py-20 md:py-28">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="text-center">
        <div class="inline-block mb-6">
          <span class="inline-flex items-center px-4 py-2 rounded-full text-sm font-medium bg-white/80 backdrop-blur-sm text-flexio border border-purple-200 shadow-lg">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4 mr-2" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12h6m-6 4h6m2 5H7a2 2 0 01-2-2V5a2 2 0 012-2h5.586a1 1 0 01.707.293l5.414 5.414a1 1 0 01.293.707V19a2 2 0 01-2 2z"></path>
            </svg>
            Detaljni opisi programa
          </span>
        </div>

        <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6 font-display leading-tight">
          Opis satova
        </h1>
        <p class="text-xl text-gray-700 mb-8 max-w-3xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
          Saznajte sve o našim Pilates i Yoga programima
        </p>

        <!-- Stats -->
        <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-8 mt-8">
          <div class="text-center">
            <div class="text-3xl font-bold text-flexio mb-2">7</div>
            <div class="text-sm text-gray-600 uppercase tracking-wide">Pilates programa</div>
          </div>
          <div class="h-12 w-px bg-gray-300 hidden sm:block"></div>
          <div class="text-center">
            <div class="text-3xl font-bold text-flexio mb-2">3</div>
            <div class="text-sm text-gray-600 uppercase tracking-wide">Yoga programa</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Main Content Section -->
  <section class="py-16 md:py-24 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      
      <!-- Pilates Programs Section -->
      <div class="mb-20">
        <div class="text-center mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4 font-display">
            Pilates programi
          </h2>
          <div class="w-20 h-1 bg-gradient-to-r from-flexio to-purple-700 mx-auto rounded-full"></div>
        </div>

        <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto space-y-6">
          <!-- B.A.S.I. Pilates -->
          <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-purple-50 to-pink-50 rounded-2xl p-8 md:p-10 shadow-md border border-gray-100">
            <div class="flex items-start gap-6 mb-6">
              <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-14 h-14 bg-gradient-to-br from-flexio to-purple-700 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center">
                <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                  <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path>
                </svg>
              </div>
              <div class="flex-1">
                <h3 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2 font-display">
                  B.A.S.I. Pilates
                </h3>
                <p class="text-lg font-semibold text-flexio mb-4">
                  Beginners – Intermediate – Advanced (power pilates)
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="space-y-4 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
              <p>
                Jedinstveni program koji ujedinjuje umjetnost i nauku o ljudskom pokretu sa suvremenim pristupom radu Josepha Pilatesa. Pilates Studio Flexio je <strong>prvi certificirani pilates studio u Hrvatskoj</strong> svjetski poznate američke škole B.A.S.I PILATES koja ima suvremeni pristup originalnoj metodi Josepha Pilates.
              </p>
              <p>
                Pilates osjetno povećava snagu, fleksibilnost, ravnotežu, držanje i koordinaciju, a podržali su ga i mnogi liječnici širom svijeta te se koristi kao forma fizioterapije. Jedna od najefikasnijih kompletnih kondicijskih metoda koja pomaže razvoju i jačanju mišića.
              </p>
              <p>
                Ovim programom postižemo kondiciju cijelog tijela bez upotrebe utega, iscrpljujućih vježbi i opterećenja zglobova. Danas je pilates dokazano najefektnija i najučinkovitija metoda koja ujedinjuje ravnotežu tijela i uma.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 mt-6">
              <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-purple-50 text-purple-700 rounded-full text-sm font-medium">Početnici</span>
              <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-purple-50 text-purple-700 rounded-full text-sm font-medium">Napredni</span>
              <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-purple-50 text-purple-700 rounded-full text-sm font-medium">Power</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Pre & Post Natal -->
          <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-purple-50 to-pink-50 rounded-2xl p-8 md:p-10 shadow-md border border-gray-100">
            <div class="flex items-start gap-6 mb-6">
              <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-14 h-14 bg-gradient-to-br from-flexio to-purple-700 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center">
                <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                  <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M4.318 6.318a4.5 4.5 0 000 6.364L12 20.364l7.682-7.682a4.5 4.5 0 00-6.364-6.364L12 7.636l-1.318-1.318a4.5 4.5 0 00-6.364 0z"></path>
                </svg>
              </div>
              <div class="flex-1">
                <h3 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2 font-display">
                  Pre & Post Natal
                </h3>
                <p class="text-lg font-semibold text-flexio mb-4">
                  Pilates za trudnice i mlade majke
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="space-y-4 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
              <p>
                <strong>Pre Natal Pilates</strong> - Vježbanje je veoma preporučljivo tijekom trudnoće, a pilates je savršen izbor. Pilates vježbe razvijaju snagu, fleksibilnost i ravnotežu što pomaže tijekom poroda i oporavka nakon njega. Naglasak je na jačanju trbušnih mišića, mišića zdjeličnog dna i leđa.
              </p>
              <p>
                <strong>Post Natal Pilates</strong> - Nakon poroda tijelo prolazi kroz proces oporavka. Pilates vam pomaže vratiti snagu trbušnih mišića, popraviti držanje i vratiti energiju. Vježbe su prilagođene vašem tijelu i ritmu oporavka.
              </p>
              <p>
                Program je posebno dizajniran uz konzultacije s liječnicima i stručnjacima za siguran i učinkovit trening tijekom i nakon trudnoće.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 mt-6">
              <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-purple-50 text-purple-700 rounded-full text-sm font-medium">Trudnice</span>
              <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-purple-50 text-purple-700 rounded-full text-sm font-medium">Mlade majke</span>
              <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-purple-50 text-purple-700 rounded-full text-sm font-medium">Siguran</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Morning Flow -->
          <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-purple-50 to-pink-50 rounded-2xl p-8 md:p-10 shadow-md border border-gray-100">
            <div class="flex items-start gap-6 mb-6">
              <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-14 h-14 bg-gradient-to-br from-flexio to-purple-700 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center">
                <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                  <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 3v1m0 16v1m9-9h-1M4 12H3m15.364 6.364l-.707-.707M6.343 6.343l-.707-.707m12.728 0l-.707.707M6.343 17.657l-.707.707M16 12a4 4 0 11-8 0 4 4 0 018 0z"></path>
                </svg>
              </div>
              <div class="flex-1">
                <h3 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2 font-display">
                  Morning Flow
                </h3>
                <p class="text-lg font-semibold text-flexio mb-4">
                  Jutarnji pilates za energiju
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="space-y-4 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
              <p>
                Jutarnji pilates sat dizajniran da vas osvježi, energizira i pripremi za dan koji je pred vama. Morning Flow kombinira klasične pilates vježbe s dinamičnim pokretima koji aktiviraju cijelo tijelo.
              </p>
              <p>
                Ovaj sat je savršen za one koji vole započeti dan aktivno. Vježbe su prilagođene jutarnjem vremenu - fokus je na pokretanju tijela, buđenju mišića i poboljšanju cirkulacije. Postepeno gradimo intenzitet kako se tijelo budi.
              </p>
              <p>
                Završavamo s kratkim istezanjem koje vas ostavlja opuštene ali energične, spremne za sve izazove dana.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 mt-6">
              <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-purple-50 text-purple-700 rounded-full text-sm font-medium">Jutro</span>
              <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-purple-50 text-purple-700 rounded-full text-sm font-medium">Energija</span>
              <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-purple-50 text-purple-700 rounded-full text-sm font-medium">Svi nivoi</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Big Ball -->
          <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-purple-50 to-pink-50 rounded-2xl p-8 md:p-10 shadow-md border border-gray-100">
            <div class="flex items-start gap-6 mb-6">
              <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-14 h-14 bg-gradient-to-br from-flexio to-purple-700 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center">
                <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                  <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M21 12a9 9 0 01-9 9m9-9a9 9 0 00-9-9m9 9H3m9 9a9 9 0 01-9-9m9 9c1.657 0 3-4.03 3-9s-1.343-9-3-9m0 18c-1.657 0-3-4.03-3-9s1.343-9 3-9m-9 9a9 9 0 019-9"></path>
                </svg>
              </div>
              <div class="flex-1">
                <h3 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2 font-display">
                  Big Ball
                </h3>
                <p class="text-lg font-semibold text-flexio mb-4">
                  Pilates vježbe na lopti
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="space-y-4 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
              <p>
                Pilates vježbe na velikoj lopti (Swiss Ball) dodaju novu dimenziju klasičnom pilatesu. Lopta stvara nestabilnu površinu koja zahtijeva dodatnu aktivaciju stabilizacijskih mišića.
              </p>
              <p>
                Ovaj program je odličan za razvoj ravnoteže, koordinacije i duboke stabilnosti jezgre tijela. Vježbe uključuju rad na lopti, s loptom i oko lopte - sve dizajnirano za maksimalan angažman mišića.
              </p>
              <p>
                Big Ball sat je zabavan i izazovan, pogodan za sve razine uz prilagodbu težine vježbi. Savršen izbor za one koji žele raznolikost u treningu.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 mt-6">
              <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-purple-50 text-purple-700 rounded-full text-sm font-medium">Ravnoteža</span>
              <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-purple-50 text-purple-700 rounded-full text-sm font-medium">Stabilnost</span>
              <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-purple-50 text-purple-700 rounded-full text-sm font-medium">Fun</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Rhythm Pilates -->
          <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-purple-50 to-pink-50 rounded-2xl p-8 md:p-10 shadow-md border border-gray-100">
            <div class="flex items-start gap-6 mb-6">
              <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-14 h-14 bg-gradient-to-br from-flexio to-purple-700 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center">
                <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                  <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 19V6l12-3v13M9 19c0 1.105-1.343 2-3 2s-3-.895-3-2 1.343-2 3-2 3 .895 3 2zm12-3c0 1.105-1.343 2-3 2s-3-.895-3-2 1.343-2 3-2 3 .895 3 2zM9 10l12-3"></path>
                </svg>
              </div>
              <div class="flex-1">
                <h3 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2 font-display">
                  Rhythm Pilates
                </h3>
                <p class="text-lg font-semibold text-flexio mb-4">
                  Pilates uz muziku i koreografiju
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="space-y-4 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
              <p>
                Jedinstvena fuzija pilates vježbi, plesne koreografije i dinamične muzike. Rhythm Pilates unosi element plesa u tradicionalni pilates, čineći trening zabavnim i energičnim.
              </p>
              <p>
                Sat kombinira kontrolirane pilates pokrete s ritmičkim sekvencama koje prate muziku. Rezultat je kardio trening koji jača, oblikuje i povećava fleksibilnost, ali na zabavan način koji ne osjećate kao "vježbanje".
              </p>
              <p>
                Savršen za one koji vole ples, muziku i žele unijeti element zabave u svoj fitness rutinu. Koreografija je jednostavna i lako se uči.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 mt-6">
              <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-purple-50 text-purple-700 rounded-full text-sm font-medium">Ples</span>
              <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-purple-50 text-purple-700 rounded-full text-sm font-medium">Muzika</span>
              <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-purple-50 text-purple-700 rounded-full text-sm font-medium">Zabava</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Pilates Mašine -->
          <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-purple-50 to-pink-50 rounded-2xl p-8 md:p-10 shadow-md border border-gray-100">
            <div class="flex items-start gap-6 mb-6">
              <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-14 h-14 bg-gradient-to-br from-flexio to-purple-700 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center">
                <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                  <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19.428 15.428a2 2 0 00-1.022-.547l-2.387-.477a6 6 0 00-3.86.517l-.318.158a6 6 0 01-3.86.517L6.05 15.21a2 2 0 00-1.806.547M8 4h8l-1 1v5.172a2 2 0 00.586 1.414l5 5c1.26 1.26.367 3.414-1.415 3.414H4.828c-1.782 0-2.674-2.154-1.414-3.414l5-5A2 2 0 009 10.172V5L8 4z"></path>
                </svg>
              </div>
              <div class="flex-1">
                <h3 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2 font-display">
                  Pilates mašine
                </h3>
                <p class="text-lg font-semibold text-flexio mb-4">
                  Reformer, Cadillac, Wunda Chair, Ladder Barrel
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="space-y-4 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
              <p>
                Pilates mašine predstavljaju vrhunac pilates treninga. Reformer, Cadillac, Wunda Chair i Ladder Barrel omogućavaju personalizirani pristup koji se ne može postići samo vježbanjem na podlozi.
              </p>
              <p>
                <strong>Individualni satovi</strong> - Potpuno personalizirani program prilagođen vašim ciljevima, tjelesnoj konstituciji i razini. Savršeno za one koji traže maksimalne rezultate, rehabilitaciju ili imaju specifične zdravstvene potrebe.
              </p>
              <p>
                <strong>Poluindividualni satovi (3-4 osobe)</strong> - Mali grupe koje omogućavaju individualnu pažnju instruktora uz socijalnu komponentu grupnog treninga. Odličan omjer cijene i kvalitete.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 mt-6">
              <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-purple-50 text-purple-700 rounded-full text-sm font-medium">Reformer</span>
              <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-purple-50 text-purple-700 rounded-full text-sm font-medium">Individualno</span>
              <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-purple-50 text-purple-700 rounded-full text-sm font-medium">Pro</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Pilates na stolcu -->
          <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-purple-50 to-pink-50 rounded-2xl p-8 md:p-10 shadow-md border border-gray-100">
            <div class="flex items-start gap-6 mb-6">
              <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-14 h-14 bg-gradient-to-br from-flexio to-purple-700 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center">
                <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                  <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 10h18M7 15h1m4 0h1m-7 4h12a3 3 0 003-3V8a3 3 0 00-3-3H6a3 3 0 00-3 3v8a3 3 0 003 3z"></path>
                </svg>
              </div>
              <div class="flex-1">
                <h3 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2 font-display">
                  Pilates na stolcu
                </h3>
                <p class="text-lg font-semibold text-flexio mb-4">
                  Pilates za starije i one s ograničenom pokretljivošću
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="space-y-4 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
              <p>
                Posebno dizajniran program za starije osobe i sve one koji imaju poteškoće s vježbanjem na podlozi. Sve vježbe izvode se sjedeći na stolcu ili uz pomoć stolca za podršku.
              </p>
              <p>
                Program poboljšava snagu, ravnotežu, fleksibilnost i mobilnost zglobova - sve ključno za očuvanje nezavisnosti u svakodnevnom životu. Vježbe su nježne za zglobove, ali učinkovite za mišiće.
              </p>
              <p>
                Poseban naglasak je na prevenciji padova, poboljšanju držanja i održavanju funkcionalne snage. Siguran i učinkovit način da ostanete aktivni bez obzira na dob.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 mt-6">
              <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-purple-50 text-purple-700 rounded-full text-sm font-medium">Stariji</span>
              <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-purple-50 text-purple-700 rounded-full text-sm font-medium">Siguran</span>
              <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-purple-50 text-purple-700 rounded-full text-sm font-medium">Prilagođeno</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Yoga Programs Section -->
      <div class="mb-16">
        <div class="text-center mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4 font-display">
            Yoga programi
          </h2>
          <div class="w-20 h-1 bg-gradient-to-r from-flexio to-purple-700 mx-auto rounded-full"></div>
        </div>

        <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto space-y-6">
          <!-- Power Vinyasa Yoga -->
          <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-purple-50 to-pink-50 rounded-2xl p-8 md:p-10 shadow-md border border-gray-100">
            <div class="flex items-start gap-6 mb-6">
              <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-14 h-14 bg-gradient-to-br from-flexio to-purple-700 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center">
                <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                  <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z"></path>
                </svg>
              </div>
              <div class="flex-1">
                <h3 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2 font-display">
                  Power Vinyasa Yoga
                </h3>
                <p class="text-lg font-semibold text-flexio mb-4">
                  Dinamična yoga za snagu i energiju
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="space-y-4 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
              <p>
                Power Vinyasa je intenzivan, dinamičan stil yoge koji kombinira snagu, fleksibilnost i meditaciju u pokretu. Karakterizira ga kontinuirani tok pokreta povezanih s dahom (vinyasa flow).
              </p>
              <p>
                Svaki sat je jedinstvena kreativna sekvenca koja gradi snagu cijelog tijela, poboljšava kardiovaskularnu kondiciju i razvija mentalnu fokusiranost. Temperature u sali su prirodne - radimo na vašoj unutarnjoj vatri koja zagrijava tijelo.
              </p>
              <p>
                Sat je fizički zahtjevan ali prilagodljiv - svaka pozicija ima modifikacije za različite razine. Savršeno za one koji vole izazove i žele kombinirati snagu, fleksibilnost i duhovni aspekt yoge.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 mt-6">
              <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-purple-50 text-purple-700 rounded-full text-sm font-medium">Intenzivno</span>
              <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-purple-50 text-purple-700 rounded-full text-sm font-medium">Dinamično</span>
              <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-purple-50 text-purple-700 rounded-full text-sm font-medium">Vinyasa</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Ashtanga Mysore -->
          <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-purple-50 to-pink-50 rounded-2xl p-8 md:p-10 shadow-md border border-gray-100">
            <div class="flex items-start gap-6 mb-6">
              <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-14 h-14 bg-gradient-to-br from-flexio to-purple-700 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center">
                <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                  <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 3v1m0 16v1m9-9h-1M4 12H3m15.364 6.364l-.707-.707M6.343 6.343l-.707-.707m12.728 0l-.707.707M6.343 17.657l-.707.707M16 12a4 4 0 11-8 0 4 4 0 018 0z"></path>
                </svg>
              </div>
              <div class="flex-1">
                <h3 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2 font-display">
                  Ashtanga Mysore
                </h3>
                <p class="text-lg font-semibold text-flexio mb-4">
                  Tradicionalna praksa s individualnim pristupom
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="space-y-4 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
              <p>
                Ashtanga Mysore je tradicionalni način učenja Ashtanga yoge koji potječe iz Mysore-a u Indiji. Za razliku od "vođenih" satova, u Mysore stilu svaki vježbač radi svoju praksu vlastitim tempom.
              </p>
              <p>
                Instruktor pruža individualne upute, prilagodbe i pomoć svakom praktičaru prema njihovim potrebama i mogućnostima. Počinjete s osnovama i postepeno gradite praksu dodavanjem novih pozicija kako napredujete.
              </p>
              <p>
                Mysore stil omogućava personaliziranu praksu unutar grupnog okruženja - savršeno za početnike koji trebaju više pažnje, ali i za iskusne vježbače koji žele produbiti svoju praksu. Jutarnje vrijeme je tradicionalno za ovu praksu.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 mt-6">
              <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-purple-50 text-purple-700 rounded-full text-sm font-medium">Jutro</span>
              <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-purple-50 text-purple-700 rounded-full text-sm font-medium">Personalizirano</span>
              <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-purple-50 text-purple-700 rounded-full text-sm font-medium">Ashtanga</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Vinyasa Basic -->
          <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-purple-50 to-pink-50 rounded-2xl p-8 md:p-10 shadow-md border border-gray-100">
            <div class="flex items-start gap-6 mb-6">
              <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-14 h-14 bg-gradient-to-br from-flexio to-purple-700 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center">
                <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                  <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M14.828 14.828a4 4 0 01-5.656 0M9 10h.01M15 10h.01M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"></path>
                </svg>
              </div>
              <div class="flex-1">
                <h3 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2 font-display">
                  Vinyasa Basic (Slow Flow)
                </h3>
                <p class="text-lg font-semibold text-flexio mb-4">
                  Opuštajuća yoga za sve razine
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="space-y-4 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
              <p>
                Vinyasa Basic ili Slow Flow je nježnija verzija dinamične yoge, idealna za početnike, starije vježbače ili bilo koga tko preferira mirniji tempo. Zadržavamo princip vinyase - povezivanje pokreta s dahom - ali u opuštenijem ritmu.
              </p>
              <p>
                Sat pruža vrijeme za detaljno učenje pravilne tehnike svake pozicije. Fokus je na sigurnom izvođenju, razumijevanjuAlignment principa i građenju snage i fleksibilnosti postupno i pažljivo.
              </p>
              <p>
                Opuštena atmosfera čini ovaj sat savršenim za dekomprесiju nakon napornog dana. Završavamo s dugom relaksacijom i možda kratkom meditacijom. Svi nivoi su dobrodošli.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 mt-6">
              <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-purple-50 text-purple-700 rounded-full text-sm font-medium">Slow Flow</span>
              <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-purple-50 text-purple-700 rounded-full text-sm font-medium">Početnici</span>
              <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-purple-50 text-purple-700 rounded-full text-sm font-medium">Opuštanje</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
